        "story": "I glance back toward the open door, but Rhonda isn't trotting in behind me balancing a cake against her bosom. There aren't even discount decorations in here -- no wispy paper streamers absently taped under the buzzing light fixture or silvery birthday sign that is well past retirement. I take another tentative step inside the room, visibly stirring up the dust in the stiff air. My mouth dries and my brain starts to swim. Just three hours ago, the office stress case, Larry Goodwin, was all sweat sheened and breathy in the copy room as he warned some guy in payroll that massive layoffs were on the horizon. But I shrugged it off. The doodling man lets his pen fall onto the notepad and he grins uncertainly at me. I don't know why they decided to invite a high school gym coach to help fire me -- unless the goal is maximum shame?",
        "story_cn": "我回头瞥向敞开的门，但罗并没有捧着蛋糕跟进来。屋里甚至连打折买的装饰品都没有——嗡嗡作响的日光灯下没有随意粘贴的飘忽纸穗，更无那幅早已该退休的银色生日横幅。我试探性又往里迈了一步，明显搅动了凝滞空气里的尘埃。喉咙发干，脑髓开始晕眩。仅仅三小时前，那个办公室焦虑症患者拉里·古德温还在复印间汗涔涔地喘着气，警告某个财务部的人说大规模裁员即将到来。可我当初耸肩就当耳旁风。涂鸦的男人松开笔任其落在记事本上，朝我挤出个不确定的笑。我实在想不通他们为何要请个高中体育老师来参与解雇我——除非是为了追求极致羞辱效果？",
