        "beatId": 13,
        "story": "There are so many eligible bachelors.\" Good god, I've set off a terrible alarm. The aunty dating arrangement call is possibly the most precarious situation to be in. But the worst offender, my mom, calls over the waiter again, and her Farsi is too fast for me to track. Maybe she's ordering champagne to celebrate me saying I want to date? It's when Mom points at me that my heart stops. Roya laughs and says, \"Oh, your mom's so excited she's asking the waiter if he's single.\" \"She isn't?\" I ask, even though I know the answer. All the guilt I had about hurting Mom dissolves like it always does at some point in our interactions, and I remember exactly why I moved away. I shouldn't have come here.",
        "story_cn": "“优质单身汉那么多呢。”老天，我捅了马蜂窝。这场“相亲热线”堪称最凶险的修罗场。而罪魁祸首——我妈，竟又召来侍应生，她的波斯语快得我跟不上节奏。莫非是要开香槟庆祝我终于想通要约会？当她指向我时，我心跳骤停。罗娅笑出声：“你妈妈兴奋得在问侍应生是不是单身呢。”“不是吗？”我明知故问。所有伤害母亲的负罪感如往常那样在母女交锋中消散，我忽然记起当初离家的真正原因——本不该来的。",
