        "beatId": 1,
        "story": "The \"grocery shop of shame\" is a form of modern art that peaks in its grandeur at the conveyer belt. My post - aunty dinner angst may have influenced what went into the basket. Plus, the signature sky-blue color painted all over Supershops -- the same shade that brands everything in our office -- triggers something in me that can only be cured by processed foods. All the items that I plan to purchase and consume are splayed out and slowly gliding toward the cashier, a visual representation of the state of my mental health. The weeks when I get the marshmallow strawberries and the Corn Nuts are particular cries for help. The key to a successful grocery shop of shame is all about timing. Eight p.m. on a Monday is usually the safest hour if you want a little discretion, but somehow there are two people behind me tonight.",
        "story_cn": "“羞耻杂货铺”堪称现代艺术，而其巅峰展现在那条传送带上。姨妈家晚餐后的焦虑大概影响了购物篮的内容物。加之超市品牌标志性的天蓝色——和我们办公室里那种令人窒息的同款色调——总能触发我某种症状，唯有加工食品方能治愈。此刻所有我计划购买并吞下的食物，正摊开在传送带上缓缓滑向收银台，这简直是对我精神健康状态的视觉解构。特别是那些买了棉花糖草莓和玉米坚果的日子，简直是在大声呼救。经营好这家羞耻杂货铺的关键在于时机。周一晚上八点通常是保持体面的最佳时段，但偏偏今晚我身后就站了两个人。",
