        "story": "So I was at least a partial dong today. A weenie.\" His flashes me an entreating grin, and I accept it. It seeps through my warming skin. \"Being colleagues and carpool buddies is a little trickier than imagined.\" \"True,\" I agree. \"Maybe we need some ground rules,\" he offers. \"Like, nothing we discuss here should influence how we do our jobs there.\" \"So in here I'm allowed to be myself, raw and uncut?\" \"That's encouraged.\" \"Thank fuck,\" I say, and he chuckles. \"Just making sure. I'm big on following rules to a T, so if there are any exceptions, beyond the normal ones, let me know now.\" \"Fair enough,\" he smirks.",
        "story_cn": "“所以我今天顶多算半个混账。是个怂包。”他朝我讨好地咧嘴一笑，我接受了。暖意渗入我渐暖的皮肤。“当同事兼拼车伙伴，比想象中复杂点。”“确实。”我赞同。“或许我们该定些基本准则，”他提议。“比如，咱们在这儿聊的内容，不影响在那边的工作表现。”“所以在这里我可以做自己，生猛原味？”“鼓励如此。”“谢天谢地，”我说，他轻笑出声。“只是确认一下。我这人最讲究严守规矩，所以如果有任何例外——在正常例外之外——现在就告诉我。”“很公平，”他得意一笑。",
