        "beatId": 14,
        "story": "\"This morning, I slipped in that we should plot to murder someone, and you nodded aggressively.\" \"That's not fair.\" I put my palm to my chest. \"I was listening, but I didn't want to make you feel weird for having a murder plan, since you're new and all.\" Our eyes lock, and I can see the silent laughter in his. I internally breathe a sigh of relieve that we are on safe ground again. \"Anyway, now we're talking. Who of the people at work would you kill?\" He coughs, eyes going wide. \"What the hell?\" \"I know, I know, you're new -- hardly know us. But just go with your gut. Might be fun to compare answers after a while working there.\" \"I just -- \" He swallows hard.",
        "story_cn": "“今天早上我偷换概念说咱们该合谋杀人，你还猛点头附和。”“这不公平。”我手掌抵住胸口。“我确实在听，但怕你刚来，说出谋杀计划会显得怪异。”四目相对时，我看见他眼底憋着的笑意。内心暗松口气——终于回到安全区了。“话说回来，既然聊开了：同事里你最想杀谁？”他呛咳起来，眼睛瞪得滚圆：“搞什么鬼？！”“懂懂懂，你是新人，跟我们还不熟。但凭直觉选一个嘛。等共事久了再对答案，说不定挺有趣。”“我只是——”他艰难地咽了下口水。",
