        "story": "\"What are you doing out here? I mean, in my hallway?\" \"I came to give you this.\" She holds out a hand, and I notice for the first time that she is holding a mess of black and white yarn. \"Your birthday gift.\" I eye it warily. It looks like a bunch of loose black and white strings tied together, with two googly eyeballs glued onto the situation, seemingly on purpose. Is this a prank where I have to pretend to think it's beautiful, and then she laughs at me? \"It was meant to be a zebra,\" she clarifies. Miley chews her hangnail, insecure as she waits for me to respond, and my heart tumbles like a domino. That's why she wanted to know my favorite animal.",
        "story_cn": "“你在这儿干嘛？我是说，在我走廊里？”“我来给你这个。”她伸出手，我这才注意到她手里攥着一团乱糟糟的黑白毛线。“你的生日礼物。”我警惕地打量着它。看起来就是一堆散乱的黑白线绑在一起，上面还粘着两颗咕噜转的眼珠子，显然是故意的。这是不是那种我得假装觉得漂亮，然后她就会笑话我的恶作剧？“本来想钩成斑马的，”她解释道。梅莉咬着手指边的倒刺，等我反应时显得局促不安，我的心像多米诺骨牌一样塌陷下去。这就是她想知道我最喜欢什么动物的原因。",
