        "story": "Laughter and gibes that I was eating a thermos of slime still ring in my ears. But as Armin's glossy hair and frown appear, a wave of relief floods me so much that a smile falls on my lips. The microwave beeps, and when I take out the steaming container, he eyes it curiously and says, \"Ashe?\" I nod, and he claps once. \"It's been so long since I've smelled it. My mom hasn't cooked in forever. I didn't realize I was missing it.\" I turn to face him. \"I get it, it hits different than restaurant versions.\" \"Right!\" He claps again and pulls from the fridge a doogh -- a minty yogurt soda that a lot of people find off-putting, but if you're most Persians, you'd crime-spree for it. He holds it up.",
        "story_cn": "那些关于“我带着一罐黏液当午餐”的嘲笑与讥讽仍在耳畔。但当阿明油亮的头发与蹙眉出现时，宽慰感汹涌而来，令我嘴角扬起笑意。微波炉嘀声响起，我取出蒸腾的餐盒，他好奇地端详着：“香草浓汤？”我点头，他击掌叹道：“太久没闻这味道了。我母亲早就不下厨了。竟不知自己如此想念。”我转身面对他，“我懂，和餐馆里的滋味终究不同。”“没错！”他又拍了下手，从冰箱取出一瓶薄荷酸奶汽水——许多人觉得怪异，但对大多数波斯人而言，这简直是能为它犯罪的珍馐。他将瓶子举到我面前。",
