        "story": "Something catches in my throat, and I blink far more than necessary. When we pull up to a beautiful little century-old apartment building with a perfect red door, I blink and blink as an attractive brunette in a trendy, oversized wool jacket with clunky boots and heavy makeup trots toward the car. She walks with such a sure-footed stride that I'm half convinced she owns the sidewalk. \"I can give her my seat,\" I offer, my smile as delicate as a porcelain doll. \"No, don't worry, Grace's cool. Just stay put.\" I don't know why I feel the urge to clarify that I'm just as cool. This Grace opens the back door and says, \"We're never going to make it unless you book it now. What, did you need them to pave the roads before you could drive here?\" Grace's spicy perfume wafts toward me as she settles into the back.",
        "story_cn": "我喉头一哽，眨眼的频率高得离谱。车子停在一栋漂亮的百年小公寓楼前，那扇完美的红门映入眼帘。我眨了又眨，只见一位穿着时髦超大廓形羊毛外套、蹬着笨重靴子、浓妆艳抹的棕发丽人正朝车小跑而来。她步伐笃定得让我恍惚觉得人行道是她的私有领地。“我可以把座位让给她，”我提议道，笑容精致如瓷娃娃。“别，没事，格蕾丝很随和。坐着别动。”不知为何，我竟想辩解自己同样“随和”。格蕾丝拉开后座车门说道：“再不抓紧可就迟了。怎么，难道还得给你把路铺平才肯开过来吗？”她落座后，浓烈辛辣的香水气息朝我扑来。",
