        "story": "Even though we all tease that we'll quit, we know this company can more easily part with us. I sit down at my desk and keep readjusting where Miley's zebra goes. Somehow the dire blankness of the beige and grey metal brackets has become more draining to my soul. Shouldn't I have wanted to personalize my desk before? Larry's words echo inside me: Don't fear for me. Fear for you.",
