        "beatId": 6,
        "story": "I lean back in my seat and look around his office. Every object -- the signed baseball in a glass case, the nail clippers on the desk, his special golden Supershops mug -- compounds and lowers my spirit. On the wall behind him are framed awards, all meaningless, the kind designed by corporate to keep employees like him -- like all of us -- in line. It's all so useless. Yet he's the upper echelon of this office -- and more broadly, the world. For once, I'm able to stare at him longer than a few seconds without shuddering away. He holds himself proudly, his sausage fingers woven together confidently. Gregory's below average in every facet one could evaluate a human on.",
        "story_cn": "我靠回椅背，环视他的办公室：玻璃罩里的签名棒球、桌上的指甲钳、他那只定制金色超级商店马克杯……每件物件都在累积某种令人消沉的重量。身后墙面挂满镶框奖项——尽是些公司为驯服他这类（以及我们这类）雇员设计的空洞符号。这简直荒谬透顶。而他却是这间办公室乃至更广阔世界的所谓上层。此刻我竟能凝视他超过数秒而不战栗。他昂首自得，香肠般的手指自信地交叠。格里戈里在人性所能丈量的每个维度，都低于平均值。",
