        "story": "I peel my crusted eyes open, wiping the residual tears away. It's not quite dark in my living room, but the sun has given up for the day. I remember putting on Schitt's Creek, pouring alcohol into me, and letting the bitterness creep in. Bitterness about everything that's ever happened until my brain and body couldn't take anymore. I pull myself up from the musty couch that has been soaked in misery, every muscle and joint sore from my void slumber, from the heaviness in my chest. I'm still in my stiff work pants. I somehow managed my shirt off but not my bra, so it's all twisted. I push the half-empty wine bottle onto the far end of the couch, where it'll stay put for later.",
        "story_cn": "我糊住的眼皮勉强睁开，抹掉眼角未干的泪痕。客厅里还没有完全暗下来，但太阳今天已经投降了。我记得自己点开了《富家穷路》，把酒倒进喉咙，任由苦涩一点点漫上来——对过往一切的苦涩，直到意识与身体双双崩溃。我从这张浸满愁苦的霉味沙发上撑起身，每块肌肉、每个关节都在隐隐作痛，来自虚空中的昏睡，也来自胸口沉甸甸的压迫。身上还穿着硬邦邦的西裤。不知怎么竟脱掉了衬衫却忘了解胸衣，此刻全都拧绞在一起。我把喝剩半瓶的酒推到沙发最远处，留待稍后再饮。",
