        "beatId": 18,
        "story": "I can understand feeling like you had no choice.\" She nods again shakily, but I can tell she's holding herself together. \"And I'm so sorry about reading your emails and messing with your job. I truly am.\" Moisture shines in the corners of her eyes. She dares a tiny smile as she quietly mouths, \"Thank you,\" then dabs her eyes with a tissue from her purse. \"Congrats on the promotion, by the way. Cliff told me.\" My smile is genuine. Her eyes lock on to mine, a little steadier. \"I appreciate it.\" \"Also, I should thank you too.\" \"For what?\" \"For helping me lose that job.\" She blinks at me, then a high-pitched cackle escapes her.",
        "story_cn": "“我能理解那种别无选择的感受。”她再次颤抖着点头，但我看得出她在强撑。“还有真的很抱歉擅自看你的邮件、搅黄你的工作。我是真心的。”她眼角泛起水光，尝试扬起一个细小的微笑时轻轻说了句“谢谢”，随后从包里抽出纸巾轻拭眼角。“顺便恭喜你升职，克里夫告诉我的。”我的笑容是真诚的。她的目光落回我眼中，稍显稳定：“我很感激。”“另外，我也该谢谢你。”“谢什么？”“谢谢你让我丢了那份工作。”她怔了怔，随即发出一串清脆的笑声。",
